    <string name="permission_banner_text">To reply for you, agento needs to read your notifications. Nothing leaves your phone: replies go out through each app\'s own reply button.</string>
    <string name="permission_title">One permission to start</string>
    <string name="permission_explainer">To answer your customers, agento needs to: 1) read notifications from your messaging apps, and 2) be excluded from battery optimization so the system doesn\'t kill it in the background. Android settings will open first — find "agento" and turn it on. When you come back, also accept the battery permission.</string>
